  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1282/934/logo.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvalarian-conquest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/7aDHD6YVVX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></strong></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fethan919\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《瓦拉里安征戰》旨在提升主世界中的整體戰鬥與探索體驗。本模組新增了多個陣營、建築結構與生物，致力於讓世界更顯生機勃勃、充滿中世紀風情且富有探索價值。截至4.0版本更新，模組已包含眾多陣營，並為每個陣營設計了獨特的盔甲與建築。先前版本中部分人類與奇幻陣營仍在持續開發中，將隨未來更新逐步回歸。玩家可選擇加入並結盟這些陣營，在其建築內可發現待救援的居民，救援後可將其收編為己方成員。這些居民一旦被收編，便能擔任村民職業或戰鬥角色，並伴隨玩家展開冒險旅程。未來我期望能擴展此模組的功能，加入更多令人興奮的遊戲元素。請注意，這是我首次嘗試開發模組，若您發現任何錯誤或問題，歡迎隨時告知，我將盡力修正。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組無強制依賴性，但部分模組可提升遊戲體驗：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structurify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structurify</a> - 可調整建築生成機制，使其更貼近自然</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/valarian-conquest-ef-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight 相容性擴充</a> - 為生物添加史詩戰鬥動畫與戰鬥系統</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-player-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations 生物相容性</a> - 為生物添加全新動畫效果</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mob-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat 生物相容性</a> - 為生物添加優化戰鬥動畫</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/91/screenshot-2025-11-30-123416.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/94/screenshot-2025-11-29-212759.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/108/screenshot-2025-11-29-225400.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/96/screenshot-2025-12-15-172008.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/98/screenshot-2025-11-29-213821.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/115/screenshot-2025-12-15-163801.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/116/screenshot-2025-12-15-163846.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/102/screenshot-2025-12-02-212929.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/101/screenshot-2025-12-04-232800.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/103/screenshot-2025-12-03-201638.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/145/screenshot-2025-12-15-172441.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/107/screenshot-2025-12-02-213519.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/105/screenshot-2025-11-29-212906.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/117/screenshot-2025-11-30-124937.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/109/screenshot-2025-12-15-171654.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1428/97/screenshot-2025-12-02-222819.png\">&nbsp;</p>",
